  message: "DONE (work_item; the invariant closure clauses are on the sub-metas) — cli-output block COMPLETE. Umbrella 'multiple JSON output conventions / no unified contract' resolved across all dimensions: (F1) add_schema_envelope single-sources the read-view wire shape; (sub-A INV-fivar satisfied) JSON pathway on every structured-data read subcommand; (sub-B INV-pikob satisfied) standard envelope, no bare arrays; (sub-C INV-rugah satisfied) JSON keys/presence agree with bm.json schema (check-schema-coverage gate green) + pass->pass_id documented in machine schema + spec §289/§742; (flag-spelling uniformity WI-kitud done, PR #537 / dev 4d933c251f) all 8 text-defaulting read views now use --format text|json, --json a back-compat alias. WI-gogif's expectation — 'one consistent convention for JSON output (such as a --format text|json flag pair) with consistent envelope fields' — met for the text-defaulting read views; slice/compact are a distinct JSON-only category (no text mode), out of scope. WI-pofas folded (duplicate, anon_id ITEM-e5ca58). Final-piece behavioral evidence: live --format json / --json / --format text repros on io-boundaries + verify-claims (WI-kitud closure)."  # 7e90
